[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（…………）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(......)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……騒がしい）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(...so noisy.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（――懐かしい香りだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(...that smell. I know that smell.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（昔、ザスキアが作ってくれたスープ……\n\u3000あれによく似ている）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The soup Saskia used to make us... it's just like that.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（いや、似ているが違う。\n\u3000これは、俺がゼロたちに作るスープの香りだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(No—similar, but different. This is the smell of the soup I made for Zero and the others.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（あいつらが落ち込んでいたり、くじけているとき、\n\u3000あのスープを作ってやると喜んでいた……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Whenever they were down or ready to give up, I'd make that soup for them. They always looked so happy...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（長兄として、自分がされて嬉しかったことを、\n\u3000真似していただけなんだがな）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I was just doing what had been done for me. What made me feel better, when I was the one struggling.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……もう久しく作っていない）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(...I haven't made it in a long time.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふむ、こんなものでしょう。\nゼロ姉様、味加減をご確認ください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...That should do it, I think. Zero, would you taste this and check the seasoning?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どれどれ……ほう、うまいのう。\nこれぞ、忘れがたき兄者の味じゃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's see... mmm. Yes. This is it—this is brother's taste. Unforgettable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……もう俺が、作ることもないだろう。\n\u3000俺は敗北したのだから）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(...I won't be making it again. Not after losing like this.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（俺は、英雄などではなかった。\n\u3000こんなところで負けてしまうようでは）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I was never a hero. A real hero wouldn't fall here, like this.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（兄弟たちも、俺の導きなどなしに\n\u3000お互いで支え合って、上手くやれている）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The others... they're supporting each other just fine. They don't need my guidance at all.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……兄がいなくとも、\n\u3000こいつらはもう大丈夫なんだ……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(...They're going to be alright. Even without their brother...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……もう、すべてどうでもいい――）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(...None of it matters anymore--)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし、完成ね！\nうーん、いい匂い！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Done! Alright, that smells absolutely amazing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "兄弟みんなの協力で完成した、兄様のスープ……！\nこんな日が来るなんて……私は嬉しいぞ……！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A soup made by all of his siblings together, just for brother... I never thought this day would come... I'm so happy...!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっとゴゥ、感極まるには気が早いよ！\nほら、スープよそうから手伝っておくれ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Easy there, Gou, we're not at the finish line yet! Come help us ladle it out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イェルカ姉貴、手伝うよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll help too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では私は、食卓の準備を",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then I will set the table."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとね！\u3000それじゃ、ヴァレリアとシトリンは\nヘル兄を席に案内してあげとくれ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks! Valeria, Citrine—take Held over to his seat!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんで僕が……はぁ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why me... ugh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう、シトリン、文句言わないで！\n兄弟みんなで協力しましょ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, stop complaining! We're all working together here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヘルト、待たせたわね！\nご飯できたわよー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held, sorry for the wait! Dinner's ready!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……はぁ、無視してくれちゃってさ、\nほんと、拍子抜けだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Great, he's ignoring us. What a letdown."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ほら、行くよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Come on, let's go."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さ、みんなでスープを食べましょ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright everyone, let's eat!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]